<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>We are feasting with our Savior,</l><l>He with us and we with Him;</l><l>Hallelujah, hallelujah!</l><l>Feast of feasts that ne’er will end!</l><l>Eating, drinking with Thyself, Lord,</l><l>We are wholly satisfied.</l><l>Taste we of that glorious banquet</l><l>Thou wilt share with us, Thy Bride.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
